<title>USA: Virologix IPO shares cut -- underwriter.</title>
<headline>Virologix IPO shares cut -- underwriter.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The proposed number of shares for the planned initial public offering of Virologix Corp was lowered to 1.075 million from 1.15 million previously, lead underwriter Rickel &amp; Associates said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The initial public offering has maintained its proposed target price at $6 and the proposed symbol on the Nasdaq National Market.  The initial public offering is expected to trade next Wednesday.</p>
<p>Virologix is a biotechnical company.</p>
</text>
